        <p>The material supplied to the model sets the scope of what it can draw on. Its answer is a reading of that record, and the source links let visitors inspect the original wording and context for themselves. Visitors can also listen to the answer in an AI voice trained on recordings of my own voice.</p>
        <div class="process-strip" data-scroll-group data-scroll-step="100">
