        </div>
        <p>When I began using <AiAskTerm /> myself, I found another reason to keep exploring it. I knew the individual pieces on the site, yet a question could bring a research interest, a project, and a fragment into a relationship I had rarely considered. Something I had made to help visitors get answers was also giving me a way to reread my own material. I wanted to give those connections more room to develop.</p>
