        <p>A new <AiViewTerm /> might place a familiar fragment beside a research problem I began thinking about years after writing it. A project may appear alongside a more recent experience that changes which part of it catches my attention. The earlier saved reading stays as it was, making it possible to compare how those pieces were understood at different points.</p>
